~ start
Nasim: What a pleasure to meet you, Cupid, and to receive your help.
Cupid: Greetings heir of Crathod, the pleasure is all mine. Here are the pastries.

$> dialogue.start_item_requests(2)

if dialogue.all_acceptable_items():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(2)
	=> player_choice
elif dialogue.wrong_specific_item():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(1)
	Nasim: Thank you, I will see you another time. 
elif dialogue.wrong_item_type():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(0)
	Nasim: I gave you clear instructions. Pray that your incompetence will not ruin the meeting.

=> END

~ player_choice
- Their uniqueness lies in requiring a specific charcoal oven to be baked in.
	Cupid: Their uniqueness lies in requiring a specific charcoal oven to be baked in.
- Their uniqueness lies in preparing the dough together with filling before baking.
	$> dialogue.increase_tier_for_correct_choice()
	Cupid: Their uniqueness lies in preparing the dough together with filling before baking.
- Their uniqueness lies in requiring the highest quality ingredients to taste any good.
	Cupid: Their uniqueness lies in requiring the highest quality ingredients to taste any good.
Nasim: Many thanks. I am too eager to stand still, so I will see you another time. 